WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:43.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.320 --> 01:44.440
Put it down.

3
01:44.520 --> 01:46.000
Slow down.

4
01:47.840 --> 01:49.200
Why are you sneaking around like that?

5
01:50.200 --> 01:51.040
Take a look.

6
01:51.840 --> 01:52.680
CINDY

7
01:52.760 --> 01:55.840
One of my inside contacts at Bolo Culture just tipped me off.

8
01:55.920 --> 01:59.320
She said she saw Lin Long getting into Mr. Shen's car after work last night,

9
01:59.400 --> 02:00.800
and they were all over each other.

10
02:00.880 --> 02:02.760
Those two have been acting weird lately.

11
02:02.840 --> 02:04.640
Ask her what's going on.

12
02:04.720 --> 02:06.680
Final delivery is coming up.

13
02:06.760 --> 02:10.240
I don't want any drama like with the Celestial project.

14
02:10.759 --> 02:11.800
Is that true?

15
02:12.800 --> 02:14.520
I just didn't drive that day.

16
02:14.600 --> 02:16.080
Mr. Shen gave me a ride.

17
02:16.160 --> 02:17.120
Is it really that big a deal?

18
02:18.000 --> 02:18.920
Cindy loves to make stuff up about me.

19
02:19.000 --> 02:19.960
It's not the first time.

20
02:21.400 --> 02:22.400
Seriously,

21
02:22.480 --> 02:23.800
I'm telling you, I've known you for years.

22
02:23.880 --> 02:26.440
You can't fool me. Your face just now gave it away.

23
02:27.600 --> 02:28.720
Did it?

24
02:28.800 --> 02:29.840
Wait, no way.

25
02:29.920 --> 02:35.400
How could you make such a rookie mistake and get tangled up with a client?

26
02:35.920 --> 02:37.680
Don't tell me your divorce messed you up so bad

27
02:37.760 --> 02:39.320
your head's not on straight?

28
02:39.920 --> 02:42.000
Listen, you need to pump the brakes.

29
02:42.520 --> 02:43.960
Don't worry. No brakes needed.

30
02:44.040 --> 02:45.360
Because nothing ever started.

31
02:45.440 --> 02:46.480
Really?

32
02:47.760 --> 02:48.840
That's good.

33
02:48.920 --> 02:51.840
I thought you weren't thinking straight and would fall for it.

34
02:51.920 --> 02:55.000
With your situation right now, how could Shen ever genuinely like you?

35
02:55.080 --> 02:57.160
He's definitely just got a whim and wants a taste of…

36
02:57.880 --> 02:59.880
A taste of something new. I get it.

37
03:00.600 --> 03:01.760
Excuse me.

38
03:02.680 --> 03:05.880
Why would a unicorn startup founder fall for someone like me,

39
03:05.960 --> 03:07.280
a divorced woman?

40
03:07.800 --> 03:11.880
So when I noticed he might be even slightly into me,

41
03:11.960 --> 03:14.160
I shut it down immediately.

42
03:14.680 --> 03:17.560
I just asked him straight up. I asked him,

43
03:17.640 --> 03:18.840
"Do you have feelings for me?"

44
03:19.360 --> 03:21.760
And sure enough, he chickened out and backed off.

45
03:22.480 --> 03:24.760
Then why did you get in his car last night?

46
03:26.320 --> 03:27.200
Because…

47
03:28.280 --> 03:30.360
Because I'm a normal human being.

48
03:30.440 --> 03:31.800
I think after clearing things up,

49
03:31.880 --> 03:35.120
I have every right to accept normal kindness from a guy.

50
03:36.240 --> 03:37.840
And what era are we living in anyway?

51
03:38.360 --> 03:41.560
I can't just feel inferior to everyone else because I'm divorced.

52
03:41.640 --> 03:43.600
That's not what I meant.

53
03:43.680 --> 03:45.480
I know.

54
03:48.040 --> 03:49.080
But I have to say,

55
03:49.640 --> 03:52.440
when a guy who's got it all together

56
03:52.520 --> 03:55.120
wants to get close to you and care for you,

57
03:55.200 --> 03:56.200
it's actually kind of nice.

58
03:57.720 --> 03:59.280
So that night,

59
03:59.360 --> 04:01.560
when he insisted on taking me to get some trendy ice cream,

60
04:02.160 --> 04:03.160
I said yes.

61
04:03.960 --> 04:05.440
But in the car, I was torn.

62
04:06.240 --> 04:08.640
Part of me hated myself for having no principles,

63
04:08.720 --> 04:10.760
but the rest of me was glad

64
04:10.840 --> 04:13.640
I still had it going on enough to make a man fall for me.

65
04:15.360 --> 04:18.920
I'm just so indecisive, hesitant…

66
04:19.000 --> 04:19.920
And a total hypocrite.

67
04:21.000 --> 04:23.200
But even now, I don't think I did anything wrong.

68
04:24.840 --> 04:25.760
Hey you.

69
04:26.280 --> 04:27.520
You didn't let him

70
04:28.760 --> 04:30.160
into your place last night, did you?

71
04:35.960 --> 04:36.840
Come in.

72
05:00.480 --> 05:01.360
Can I not answer that?

73
05:04.200 --> 05:05.040
Of course.

74
05:07.160 --> 05:12.840
MEETING ROOM

75
05:22.720 --> 05:23.920
Let's talk when we get back.

76
05:30.280 --> 05:32.240
Is it about Mr. Zheng?

77
05:34.360 --> 05:36.640
Peng Yuan was fired and handed over to economic crime investigators.

78
05:37.160 --> 05:38.640
Ma Ke is off the hook.

79
05:38.720 --> 05:40.240
His voluntary resignation is accepted.

80
05:40.760 --> 05:42.680
Yang Rui will stay on with a new team.

81
05:43.920 --> 05:46.240
The project will fully resume next week.

82
05:47.640 --> 05:48.600
We keep moving forward.

83
06:03.280 --> 06:05.600
I did my part today.

84
06:06.480 --> 06:08.360
Then keep it up

85
06:08.440 --> 06:10.640
and go buy some milk tea for everyone to celebrate.

86
06:10.720 --> 06:11.680
Mango?

87
06:11.760 --> 06:12.800
Medium matcha.

88
06:12.880 --> 06:14.320
Light ice, light sugar, no foam topping.

89
06:15.080 --> 06:16.560
Then I want choco…

90
06:19.760 --> 06:21.600
Never mind. I'm good.

91
06:35.240 --> 06:36.320
I've known Richard for so long.

92
06:37.000 --> 06:40.240
Looks like he's finally met the one.

93
07:00.720 --> 07:01.720
HUANGHE BUSINESS SCHOOL EMBA STRATEGIC MANAGEMENT

94
07:01.800 --> 07:02.800
RISKS, OPPORTUNITIES, AND STRATEGIC RESPONSES IN DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES MARKET

95
07:02.880 --> 07:04.000
SPEAKER: YE XINZHI, GUEST PROFESSOR

96
07:04.080 --> 07:04.920
The digital finance market

97
07:05.000 --> 07:07.240
is like a blue ocean full of hope and challenges.

98
07:07.760 --> 07:10.080
But opportunity and risk go hand in hand.

99
07:10.160 --> 07:11.400
The domestic crypto market

100
07:11.480 --> 07:12.680
has been through multiple rounds of strict regulation

101
07:12.760 --> 07:14.120
and is relatively stable now.

102
07:14.200 --> 07:18.200
But the blockchain finance tied to it is running wild in new forms.

103
07:18.800 --> 07:20.680
Mr. Ye, what do you think of digital collectibles?

104
07:20.760 --> 07:22.440
They're blowing up lately.

105
07:26.080 --> 07:27.920
That's a great question.

106
07:28.440 --> 07:31.280
Digital collectibles have massively expanded the art market.

107
07:31.360 --> 07:32.440
Compared to traditional collectibles,

108
07:32.520 --> 07:34.320
they have better liquidity and transparency,

109
07:34.920 --> 07:38.520
which draws a ton of eager investor attention.

110
07:38.600 --> 07:40.360
I bought a few digital collectibles to get in on the hype,

111
07:40.440 --> 07:43.360
but I've noticed a lot of people into digital collectibles

112
07:43.440 --> 07:45.480
can't really explain the business logic behind them.

113
07:45.560 --> 07:49.080
Most just see them as an alternative to crypto,

114
07:49.680 --> 07:51.000
hoping to get rich overnight.

115
07:51.080 --> 07:54.160
Especially with housing prices dropping and the stock market weak lately,

116
07:54.240 --> 07:56.400
lots of regular people jumped on the bandwagon.

117
07:56.480 --> 07:57.360
But the overhyping

118
07:57.440 --> 08:00.360
has pushed the risk to a pretty alarming level.

119
08:02.040 --> 08:05.280
Everyone, you're the ones shaping the market policy.

120
08:05.880 --> 08:08.960
And steady industry growth needs everyone's input.

121
08:09.040 --> 08:11.880
Since we're on the topic of digital collectibles today,

122
08:11.960 --> 08:13.240
I'll just assign a paper.

123
08:14.400 --> 08:15.960
Research on the Operational Models and Risk Prevention

124
08:16.040 --> 08:17.280
of Domestic Digital Collectibles.

125
08:17.880 --> 08:19.360
Work in groups.

126
08:19.440 --> 08:20.960
We'll discuss it in the next class.

127
08:21.040 --> 08:22.840
That's it for today. Class is over.

128
08:33.440 --> 08:36.559
-Mr. Ye, can we add each other on WeChat? -Sure.

129
08:38.000 --> 08:38.919
Let me scan yours.

130
08:39.000 --> 08:41.960
What you talked about today was so helpful to us.

131
08:42.039 --> 08:43.880
Hope we can hear more from you in the future.

132
08:43.960 --> 08:45.440
-Thank you. -Thanks so much.

133
08:50.560 --> 08:52.080
Hello there, Mr. Ye.

134
08:53.040 --> 08:53.880
Nice try.

135
08:53.960 --> 08:56.320
Miss Xu, you weren't paying attention in class,

136
08:56.400 --> 08:57.960
sipping milk tea and goofing off down there.

137
08:58.040 --> 08:59.720
I'm going to have to give you a serious lecture.

138
09:01.640 --> 09:03.600
Guess I'll have to bribe you then,

139
09:04.120 --> 09:05.280
so you won't fail me on the final.

140
09:06.720 --> 09:08.040
That's more like it.

141
09:17.840 --> 09:19.840
What you just said was spot on.

142
09:20.360 --> 09:22.080
You assigned the paper so naturally.

143
09:22.960 --> 09:24.520
Yuanzhou is such a hot topic right now.

144
09:24.600 --> 09:25.720
Everyone will definitely use it

145
09:25.800 --> 09:27.560
as a case study and dig deep into its problems.

146
09:29.360 --> 09:31.960
But is that really efficient?

147
09:33.440 --> 09:36.840
The person I just added on WeChat is from the Internet Finance Association.

148
09:37.520 --> 09:38.560
What do you think?

149
09:44.480 --> 09:45.960
SHEN JIN, BOLO CULTURE

150
09:54.280 --> 09:56.720
-What are you doing? -I called you 124 times.

151
09:56.800 --> 09:58.760
-Why didn't you pick up? -Didn't hear it.

152
09:59.480 --> 10:00.760
Then why did you block me on WeChat?

153
10:00.840 --> 10:02.720
I added you on WeCom, sir.

154
10:02.800 --> 10:06.400
It's easier for colleagues to reach you there going forward.

155
10:07.080 --> 10:08.320
-What did you just call me? -Sir.

156
10:09.040 --> 10:11.000
So we're being all formal now?

157
10:11.760 --> 10:13.680
Mr. Shen, we're just business partners.

158
10:15.680 --> 10:18.720
Lin Long, you're kicking me to the curb now?

159
10:18.800 --> 10:19.720
Use me and toss me aside?

160
10:19.800 --> 10:21.040
You're playing me for a fool?

161
10:21.120 --> 10:22.240
No, Mr. Shen--

162
10:22.320 --> 10:25.000
Who was it that night, all sweet and tender, asking…

163
10:25.080 --> 10:27.240
asking if her old ticket could still get her--

164
10:27.320 --> 10:28.760
Okay, stop. Nothing happened that night…

165
10:28.840 --> 10:29.960
-No, hold on… -Nothing happened that night…

166
10:30.040 --> 10:31.080
-Let's get this straight. -I completely forgot.

167
10:31.160 --> 10:32.000
Lin!

168
10:34.640 --> 10:35.960
Are you two okay?

169
10:36.560 --> 10:37.400
We're fine.

170
10:37.480 --> 10:40.360
Mr. Shen, let's just talk on WeCom if we need anything.

171
10:40.440 --> 10:41.480
I'm leaving. Bye.

172
10:41.560 --> 10:42.640
-Bye. -Bye.

173
12:05.760 --> 12:08.360
-I'm really sorry. I… -You're bleeding.

174
12:08.440 --> 12:10.680
You're pregnant. How could you drive so carelessly?

175
12:11.320 --> 12:12.320
Is the baby okay?

176
12:13.000 --> 12:15.480
Look at you. You're thin as a rail.

177
12:16.080 --> 12:19.040
If you haven't fully recovered, don't rush back to work.

178
12:19.120 --> 12:20.000
Why push yourself?

179
12:20.720 --> 12:22.080
Xu Chi brought this to me before.

180
12:22.160 --> 12:23.760
She said you specifically asked for it,

181
12:23.840 --> 12:24.640
and she passed along that message.

182
12:25.680 --> 12:27.640
"A rebirth through hardship and better days ahead."

183
12:27.720 --> 12:29.440
I've had my share of hardship.

184
12:29.520 --> 12:32.240
Now it's time to earn those better days with my own two hands.

185
12:33.880 --> 12:35.000
Want to watch this one?

186
12:36.800 --> 12:38.080
Looks boring.

187
12:38.160 --> 12:39.120
They say it's good.

188
12:40.160 --> 12:41.000
Let's go.

189
12:41.520 --> 12:43.720
I'm serious. Want to give it a shot?

190
13:15.880 --> 13:16.920
Long.

191
13:19.640 --> 13:21.280
How have you been?

192
13:29.240 --> 13:30.360
You're back at work?

193
13:30.880 --> 13:31.720
Why didn't you take more time off?

194
13:32.840 --> 13:33.680
None of your business.

195
13:34.600 --> 13:36.080
Long, listen to me.

196
13:36.160 --> 13:37.600
-I've actually always wanted to tell you… -Let go of me.

197
13:37.680 --> 13:38.640
-I don't want to hear it. -Zhiwen.

198
13:40.400 --> 13:41.320
Who is she?

199
13:43.480 --> 13:45.920
Just a friend. Just ran into each other.

200
13:46.000 --> 13:47.320
Are you playing me for a fool?

201
13:47.400 --> 13:49.040
Isn't she your ex-wife?

202
13:49.120 --> 13:49.960
What's the deal with you two?

203
13:50.040 --> 13:52.480
You're divorced and still flirting?

204
13:53.560 --> 13:55.440
He's right. He's playing you for a fool.

205
13:56.520 --> 13:57.720
Who are you calling a fool?

206
13:57.800 --> 13:59.400
You're the shameless one throwing yourself at my boyfriend!

207
13:59.480 --> 14:01.400
-Don't you know he has a girlfriend now? -Lin Long!

208
14:01.480 --> 14:02.320
I knew you'd be here.

209
14:03.480 --> 14:05.200
-Give it here. -Are these two your friends?

210
14:05.280 --> 14:06.400
Give it here.

211
14:06.480 --> 14:07.280
Car keys.

212
14:12.360 --> 14:13.640
I didn't want to say this

213
14:13.720 --> 14:17.480
because I think two women fighting over a guy is just pathetic.

214
14:18.280 --> 14:20.440
But to settle this once and for all, I'll just tell you straight.

215
14:20.520 --> 14:22.840
This guy you're treating like a prize?

216
14:22.920 --> 14:24.000
I dumped him a long time ago.

217
14:24.080 --> 14:25.360
And him?

218
14:25.440 --> 14:28.000
He chased me around in fancy cars, and I still wasn't interested.

219
14:28.080 --> 14:30.960
A divorced guy making less than me, destined to be laid off by 40,

220
14:31.040 --> 14:33.440
doing nothing but playing video games all day?

221
14:33.960 --> 14:35.040
You're welcome to him.

222
14:41.400 --> 14:42.520
She doesn't really get it.

223
14:43.880 --> 14:44.800
This car's actually nothing special.

224
14:44.880 --> 14:46.600
I've got a few more at home.

225
14:54.680 --> 14:55.840
Lin Long.

226
14:57.160 --> 14:59.320
-Stop following me. -I know.

227
14:59.840 --> 15:03.640
I just wanted to say you were really badass back there.

228
15:04.280 --> 15:05.640
Badass. Not "bad".

229
15:05.720 --> 15:06.720
I'm not insulting you.

230
15:07.240 --> 15:08.480
That day outside the bathroom,

231
15:08.560 --> 15:10.440
you went off on me just like that too.

232
15:10.520 --> 15:11.880
And I just thought…

233
15:15.440 --> 15:17.440
Do you just like getting kicked around?

234
15:18.520 --> 15:19.640
Maybe I do.

235
15:20.720 --> 15:22.880
Shen Jin. Open your eyes and look at me.

236
15:22.960 --> 15:26.040
I'm just a divorced woman trying to prove she's still got it.

237
15:26.120 --> 15:28.000
Shallow, vain, and a total coward.

238
15:28.520 --> 15:31.680
I do want to thank you for keeping me company when I was lonely.

239
15:31.760 --> 15:33.200
And sorry about just now.

240
15:33.280 --> 15:34.600
I had to use you to put on a front,

241
15:34.680 --> 15:36.840
so I could keep what little dignity I have left

242
15:36.920 --> 15:38.080
in front of my ex-husband.

243
15:39.400 --> 15:41.200
And didn't you say you felt nothing for me?

244
15:41.280 --> 15:43.160
So why are you clinging to me like this?

245
15:43.680 --> 15:44.760
Just because you can't stand losing?

246
15:46.040 --> 15:50.080
Or is it because a guy with your money has never been dumped like this before?

247
15:50.160 --> 15:52.040
So, should I pay you for emotional damages then?

248
15:56.400 --> 15:57.240
Lin Long,

249
15:58.160 --> 16:00.360
am I really that terrible?

250
16:00.440 --> 16:02.880
So terrible that you have to run away every time you see me?

251
16:03.800 --> 16:05.600
And are you really that insecure?

252
16:05.680 --> 16:09.040
All you did was get a divorce and hook up with a guy.

253
16:09.120 --> 16:12.760
How does that turn into being a coward, insecure, and shallow?

254
16:13.880 --> 16:15.160
If you were really like that,

255
16:15.240 --> 16:17.480
I wouldn't have been chasing you this long with zero shame.

256
16:19.120 --> 16:19.960
I know.

257
16:20.560 --> 16:22.120
You've been avoiding me

258
16:22.640 --> 16:27.560
because I chickened out when you asked if I had feelings for you.

259
16:28.080 --> 16:30.120
Back then, I told you it was just sympathy.

260
16:31.280 --> 16:34.880
But love isn't some high-stakes exam.

261
16:35.400 --> 16:37.160
Can't I change my answer if I got it wrong?

262
16:38.200 --> 16:41.240
I admit I didn't mean what I said that day.

263
16:41.840 --> 16:44.600
Later, I figured it out. I really regret it.

264
16:46.080 --> 16:49.320
I'm not some young girl who falls for fairy tales anymore.

265
16:49.960 --> 16:53.400
What you feel for me now is just admiration and curiosity.

266
16:53.480 --> 16:55.640
Maybe mixed with a little wounded pride and the need to win.

267
16:55.720 --> 16:56.960
If I said yes,

268
16:57.040 --> 16:58.600
you'd get bored of me in less than a month.

269
16:59.440 --> 17:00.520
And me?

270
17:00.600 --> 17:02.720
I'd be really disappointed and hurt.

271
17:02.800 --> 17:06.160
Maybe I'd fall back into that crazy mess I used to be.

272
17:06.240 --> 17:07.920
Like how I was when you first met me.

273
17:08.800 --> 17:10.800
Remember when I rear-ended your car?

274
17:10.880 --> 17:13.359
There wasn't an ounce of admiration in your eyes.

275
17:15.520 --> 17:17.760
So if you think I'm badass now,

276
17:17.839 --> 17:20.760
please just let me hold onto this fragile pride of mine. Okay?

277
17:21.920 --> 17:23.200
Because after the divorce,

278
17:24.720 --> 17:26.000
I don't have much pride left.

279
17:37.960 --> 17:38.840
Thank you.

280
18:04.280 --> 18:05.120
What are you doing here?

281
18:14.960 --> 18:16.520
Aren't you supposed to be heading to the airport?

282
18:17.600 --> 18:19.640
Driving my girlfriend to work is more important than a business trip.

283
18:19.720 --> 18:20.600
Get in.

284
18:26.600 --> 18:29.960
Actually, I just woke up to a notification that my flight got delayed.

285
18:30.040 --> 18:33.160
Plus, I have some great news for you,

286
18:33.240 --> 18:34.080
so I came over.

287
18:34.160 --> 18:36.640
What great news?

288
18:36.720 --> 18:38.120
Give me your bank account number.

289
18:38.720 --> 18:39.760
Morse's bonus came through.

290
18:39.840 --> 18:40.880
One million.

291
18:41.400 --> 18:42.840
If it's not enough for a down payment,

292
18:43.440 --> 18:44.560
I can chip in.

293
18:45.880 --> 18:46.760
It's enough.

294
18:47.280 --> 18:49.200
With what I've saved, it's definitely enough.

295
18:49.280 --> 18:50.760
And apartment prices have been dropping lately.

296
18:50.840 --> 18:51.680
This is more than enough!

297
18:54.760 --> 18:57.480
This is… This is such great news.

298
18:58.680 --> 19:01.120
Xinzhi, thank you so much.

299
19:01.640 --> 19:04.800
Don't just say it. Show me.

300
19:06.440 --> 19:07.480
You're still driving.

301
19:22.760 --> 19:24.320
Message me when you land.

302
19:24.400 --> 19:26.000
-Bye. -Bye.

303
19:33.280 --> 19:34.240
Morning.

304
19:36.440 --> 19:37.960
Morning. You're here for work too.

305
19:40.280 --> 19:42.240
Is that him? Your new boyfriend?

306
19:46.720 --> 19:47.800
Nice car.

307
19:48.800 --> 19:49.640
No wonder you broke up with me.

308
19:49.720 --> 19:52.040
We broke up because we weren't compatible,

309
19:52.120 --> 19:53.520
not because he drives a fancy car.

310
19:56.440 --> 19:57.560
I'm sorry.

311
20:00.200 --> 20:01.120
And I owe you a thank-you.

312
20:01.200 --> 20:02.640
If it weren't for you,

313
20:03.840 --> 20:05.040
I wouldn't have kept this job.

314
20:06.280 --> 20:07.120
It's fine.

315
20:09.480 --> 20:10.320
Can we still be friends?

316
20:14.080 --> 20:17.320
I've already repaid the favor from when you helped me

317
20:17.960 --> 20:18.800
during the team-building.

318
20:19.520 --> 20:20.440
Let's just be colleagues from now on.

319
20:39.800 --> 20:41.320
What are you doing here?

320
20:41.400 --> 20:42.800
They had me swap project teams with Yang Rui.

321
20:44.000 --> 20:44.880
Then go sit over there.

322
20:47.200 --> 20:48.320
Why are you still keeping your distance?

323
20:48.400 --> 20:50.200
Everyone who needs to know already knows anyway.

324
21:07.760 --> 21:10.640
The Celestial project is back on track.

325
21:10.720 --> 21:14.280
Today's meeting is mainly about restructuring the project team.

326
21:15.080 --> 21:17.000
Zhou Sen, Tianna, Du Qian.

327
21:17.080 --> 21:19.400
You'll still be in charge of your original teams.

328
21:19.920 --> 21:20.800
Okay.

329
21:21.360 --> 21:24.640
Xu Chi, IT was at the heart of the last mess,

330
21:24.720 --> 21:26.920
but I want you to take the lead on it this time.

331
21:27.640 --> 21:29.520
Li Yue has experience in this area.

332
21:29.600 --> 21:31.720
-He'll back you up. -Okay.

333
21:33.160 --> 21:34.960
As for the new project manager,

334
21:35.040 --> 21:36.720
the higher-ups haven't decided yet.

335
21:36.800 --> 21:39.120
I mean, we're already more than halfway through this project.

336
21:39.200 --> 21:42.400
Bringing in a new consultant now wouldn't be ideal.

337
21:42.480 --> 21:43.640
So Mr. Pi wants to pick

338
21:43.720 --> 21:47.120
one of the team leads to fill in as acting manager.

339
21:47.200 --> 21:48.840
I'd like to hear what everyone thinks.

340
21:50.520 --> 21:51.360
Who do you think it'll be?

341
21:51.440 --> 21:53.840
You think I've got a shot?

342
21:54.760 --> 21:56.320
But we're just analysts.

343
21:56.400 --> 21:59.080
So what? Can't we aim higher?

344
22:00.120 --> 22:01.360
I'd like to nominate Tianna.

345
22:01.440 --> 22:02.560
Ever since Ma Ke's suspension,

346
22:02.640 --> 22:05.640
she's been coordinating and running the entire project.

347
22:05.720 --> 22:06.760
Seconded.

348
22:08.880 --> 22:10.160
Wow.

349
22:11.240 --> 22:14.440
Now I finally get what it means to be the obvious choice.

350
22:16.800 --> 22:18.480
Okay. Then let's congratulate Tianna

351
22:19.080 --> 22:21.520
on becoming Maxmise's youngest project manager.

352
22:23.520 --> 22:24.880
Thank you, everyone.

353
22:30.840 --> 22:32.720
You all know I hate talking fluff,

354
22:32.800 --> 22:34.400
though that sentence itself was fluff.

355
22:34.480 --> 22:37.760
So now let me walk you through my plan and progress

356
22:37.840 --> 22:39.520
since the project kicked off.

357
22:52.120 --> 22:53.160
Jealous?

358
22:57.120 --> 22:58.320
I'm just…

359
23:00.040 --> 23:01.560
I just

360
23:02.360 --> 23:03.480
wasn't ready for this.

361
23:04.800 --> 23:08.360
Honestly, when we both got promoted to SBA around the same time,

362
23:08.440 --> 23:09.600
I was fine with it.

363
23:09.680 --> 23:14.400
But then she just shot past me and became a project manager.

364
23:14.480 --> 23:17.440
-I just feel a little… -I get it.

365
23:17.520 --> 23:21.560
Back when you took the Bolo Culture project from me,

366
23:21.640 --> 23:22.480
I felt the same way.

367
23:22.560 --> 23:25.720
-Lin… -I'm just kidding.

368
23:26.400 --> 23:29.680
Actually, this kind of thing happens all the time at the company.

369
23:29.760 --> 23:31.280
Just like Lu Le and me.

370
23:31.360 --> 23:34.880
We're friends, but we're also rivals.

371
23:34.960 --> 23:36.000
So don't worry about it.

372
23:36.080 --> 23:37.720
After a few more times, you'll get used to it.

373
23:38.600 --> 23:39.640
I know.

374
23:39.720 --> 23:41.760
It's not that I'm scared to compete with her.

375
23:41.840 --> 23:43.800
When we were doing the draft for Celestial,

376
23:43.880 --> 23:45.200
we went head-to-head.

377
23:45.960 --> 23:46.880
I just…

378
23:48.560 --> 23:51.360
And Tianna didn't tell me anything.

379
23:51.440 --> 23:53.280
I didn't even know she took over the whole Celestial project

380
23:53.360 --> 23:55.000
while I was suspended.

381
23:57.560 --> 24:00.720
When you were suspended, you went to help Morse pull off a deal.

382
24:00.800 --> 24:01.880
You didn't tell Tianna about that beforehand, did you?

383
24:03.960 --> 24:06.400
There's no such thing as absolute fairness in the workplace.

384
24:06.480 --> 24:08.600
While you're grinding, other people aren't just sitting around.

385
24:09.600 --> 24:11.960
Back when Celestial and Maxmise were at each other's throats,

386
24:12.040 --> 24:14.400
everyone thought the project was done for.

387
24:14.480 --> 24:15.840
But Tianna was the only one who didn't give up.

388
24:15.920 --> 24:18.840
She went to Mr. Pi and fought to keep the project from being shut down.

389
24:18.920 --> 24:22.440
She coordinated with colleagues to go through the investigation,

390
24:22.520 --> 24:23.880
while keeping the project moving.

391
24:24.760 --> 24:27.800
So without her drive and effort,

392
24:27.880 --> 24:30.920
do you really think Celestial would've decided to restart the whole project

393
24:31.000 --> 24:32.960
the second they saw your evidence clearing Ma Ke?

394
24:40.920 --> 24:41.840
I get it.

395
24:42.880 --> 24:47.760
I really have no right to be jealous of her.

396
24:50.400 --> 24:51.280
Thanks for setting me straight.

397
24:53.000 --> 24:54.880
Call it payback.

398
24:54.960 --> 24:58.160
After all, I was a pretty lousy mentor.

399
24:58.240 --> 24:59.720
I never really gave you any real guidance.

400
25:02.560 --> 25:05.720
But now I think you're actually grounded.

401
25:05.800 --> 25:09.120
Like a girl who hasn't been out of school for long.

402
25:09.200 --> 25:13.800
Not like one of those prodigy girls you only see in books or TV shows.

403
25:18.960 --> 25:20.080
Is this more like it?

404
25:23.800 --> 25:24.920
Let me check a message.

405
25:33.520 --> 25:35.480
That's the amulet Mr. Shen gave you, right?

406
25:35.560 --> 25:36.600
You're still wearing it.

407
25:39.560 --> 25:40.400
No idea if it even works.

408
25:40.480 --> 25:42.280
I use it as a phone charm.

409
25:42.360 --> 25:43.200
Just got used to it.

410
26:44.480 --> 26:46.200
I zoned out.

411
26:46.720 --> 26:48.480
I just suddenly thought

412
26:48.560 --> 26:50.520
of something I discussed in a call with Celestial.

413
26:53.920 --> 26:54.800
Don't push yourself so hard.

414
26:56.000 --> 26:57.600
I've already been on two business trips this week.

415
26:57.680 --> 27:00.280
We only get two hours together today,

416
27:00.360 --> 27:01.440
and you're still working so hard.

417
27:01.520 --> 27:02.800
You're practically getting dark circles.

418
27:04.720 --> 27:05.800
Do I have them?

419
27:06.320 --> 27:07.400
Where?

420
27:07.480 --> 27:09.200
Just kidding.

421
27:11.160 --> 27:13.000
Back when you were my protege,

422
27:13.080 --> 27:15.200
I could only tell you to take it easy when I saw you grinding like this.

423
27:16.000 --> 27:17.880
But now, as your boyfriend,

424
27:17.960 --> 27:20.560
I have to seriously tell you to stop pushing so hard.

425
27:21.080 --> 27:23.320
Don't treat yourself like a work machine.

426
27:24.000 --> 27:26.480
Consulting is a marathon of output.

427
27:26.560 --> 27:28.120
If you keep pulling all-nighters like this,

428
27:28.200 --> 27:30.200
you'll burn yourself out sooner or later.

429
27:45.120 --> 27:47.280
What's wrong? Tired of me nagging?

430
27:49.640 --> 27:52.640
I just want your work to be easier.

431
27:54.160 --> 27:57.600
But we both prefer seeing each other strive to do better, right?

432
28:00.360 --> 28:01.200
Okay, okay.

433
28:01.720 --> 28:03.760
Whatever the lady says goes.

434
28:05.960 --> 28:07.080
I think so too.

435
28:08.520 --> 28:09.360
-Eat up. -Eat up.

436
28:22.760 --> 28:23.840
Honestly,

437
28:24.840 --> 28:26.280
I just want to push a little harder.

438
28:26.360 --> 28:28.160
I don't want to be outdone by Tianna.

439
28:30.920 --> 28:31.760
I get it.

440
28:32.480 --> 28:34.160
But don't forget

441
28:34.240 --> 28:36.000
why you got into this industry in the first place.

442
28:37.200 --> 28:39.840
Don't let specific issues get you completely bogged down.

443
28:40.640 --> 28:42.200
Of course I haven't forgotten.

444
28:42.280 --> 28:45.080
I want to be a top consultant like you,

445
28:45.160 --> 28:46.080
make partner,

446
28:46.160 --> 28:48.680
have my own office, and buy back my mom's old apartment.

447
28:50.480 --> 28:51.320
Apartment.

448
28:53.200 --> 28:55.480
I told the agent this morning that I had the money ready.

449
28:56.000 --> 28:58.120
I've been so busy all day that I forgot to ask him for an update.

450
28:58.200 --> 28:59.560
Where's my phone?

451
29:00.520 --> 29:01.360
Right here.

452
29:02.080 --> 29:03.160
Any updates?

453
29:04.240 --> 29:05.640
The agent said apartment prices dropped again.

454
29:05.720 --> 29:07.920
The guy who signed online before changed his mind and backed out.

455
29:08.680 --> 29:10.400
Then the landlord said

456
29:10.480 --> 29:13.080
if I could pay the same price, he'd sell it to me.

457
29:13.160 --> 29:14.160
That's great news.

458
29:15.640 --> 29:17.000
Hey, Zhu. This is Xu Chi.

459
29:17.080 --> 29:19.080
How did it go? When did the landlord say we could sign?

460
29:22.720 --> 29:24.440
What? How could he just change his mind like that?

461
29:24.520 --> 29:25.520
What happened?

462
29:26.720 --> 29:27.560
The landlord backed out.

463
29:27.640 --> 29:29.600
He said I need to pay in full to close the deal.

464
29:31.480 --> 29:32.360
Don't panic just yet.

465
29:32.440 --> 29:34.360
Let's head over right now and talk to him in person.

466
29:36.400 --> 29:39.160
Xu, we go way back. How could I pull anything on you?

467
29:39.240 --> 29:40.720
The landlord already agreed.

468
29:40.800 --> 29:42.400
He even went to the transaction center.

469
29:42.480 --> 29:44.880
But the paperwork to cancel the signing and get the tax refund is a hassle.

470
29:44.960 --> 29:46.760
He got annoyed and didn't want to deal with it.

471
29:47.480 --> 29:49.880
He said if he sold it to you, he'd have to make trips again,

472
29:49.960 --> 29:52.800
and waiting for your loan approval would take months.

473
29:52.880 --> 29:56.760
So either you pay in full or he's not canceling the signing.

474
29:56.840 --> 29:58.120
Come on.

475
29:58.200 --> 30:00.120
Banks approve mortgages really fast now.

476
30:00.200 --> 30:01.840
And I know people there. I definitely won't drag it out.

477
30:02.760 --> 30:03.800
How about this?

478
30:05.200 --> 30:07.480
Can you help me contact him so I can talk to him in person?

479
30:07.560 --> 30:09.680
But it's 11 p.m. now.

480
30:09.760 --> 30:10.920
He's probably asleep.

481
30:11.000 --> 30:14.320
Besides, the notes say he's only available during the day.

482
30:15.120 --> 30:16.720
-Then… Then I… -Easy now.

483
30:18.840 --> 30:20.640
The landlord really said it has to be full payment, right?

484
30:20.720 --> 30:22.640
Yes… It's true. Why would I lie to you?

485
30:22.720 --> 30:26.200
Whether you pay in full or take a loan, our commission is the same.

486
30:26.280 --> 30:28.440
The landlord wouldn't let us see the place.

487
30:28.520 --> 30:30.200
Now he's about to sell it.

488
30:30.280 --> 30:31.320
Can you take us to see it?

489
30:32.960 --> 30:33.800
Alright.

490
30:44.840 --> 30:47.120
I'll step out and take a call.

491
30:55.320 --> 30:57.760
Remember which room you stayed in as a kid?

492
31:00.320 --> 31:01.800
It should be this one.

493
31:09.080 --> 31:10.360
No, I think it was this one.

494
31:11.880 --> 31:12.920
You don't remember?

495
31:19.320 --> 31:21.400
This used to be my grandma's apartment.

496
31:22.200 --> 31:25.120
I only got to come and stay here with my mom during the holidays.

497
31:26.840 --> 31:28.040
It's been so many years.

498
31:28.920 --> 31:31.360
This place looks nothing like I remember.

499
31:37.480 --> 31:38.440
All I remember

500
31:39.680 --> 31:43.400
is that my mom sold it for 80,000 yuan to help my dad fund his business.

501
31:45.040 --> 31:47.800
Then my dad got a mistress.

502
31:48.320 --> 31:49.800
My mom divorced him.

503
31:51.080 --> 31:53.920
When my mom saw on the news that apartment prices here had skyrocketed,

504
31:54.000 --> 31:55.280
she regretted it so much.

505
31:57.720 --> 32:00.280
Before my mom passed, she told me so many times.

506
32:01.720 --> 32:04.280
She said she really wanted to go back to before she met my dad.

507
32:06.200 --> 32:07.600
Back to Beijing.

508
32:09.640 --> 32:10.800
Back to this apartment.

509
32:16.280 --> 32:17.840
But I was too young then.

510
32:18.920 --> 32:20.280
There was nothing I could do.

511
32:20.880 --> 32:24.480
Is this her wish or yours?

512
32:26.640 --> 32:27.840
Is there a difference?

513
32:30.800 --> 32:33.760
Anyway, every time I'm sad, I come here.

514
32:33.840 --> 32:38.240
Just looking at this little building and that window full of flowers,

515
32:38.760 --> 32:40.200
it's like I go back in time.

516
32:40.840 --> 32:44.600
Back to when I was happiest.

517
32:53.960 --> 32:55.360
Then let's buy this place.

518
32:57.960 --> 32:59.360
I don't have that kind of money.

519
32:59.440 --> 33:00.720
You've got me.

520
33:04.240 --> 33:05.880
That's not what I meant.

521
33:05.960 --> 33:06.920
Sometimes,

522
33:07.560 --> 33:09.440
opportunity matters more than money.

523
33:09.520 --> 33:12.480
-But I can't just use your money. -You already missed out once.

524
33:13.080 --> 33:14.400
You can't miss it again.

525
33:14.480 --> 33:16.520
If it really bothers you,

526
33:17.240 --> 33:18.720
we can sign a loan agreement.

527
33:19.720 --> 33:24.840
Chi, give me a chance to do what a boyfriend should do.

528
33:26.040 --> 33:26.880
Alright?

529
34:11.880 --> 34:12.800
Hey, ladies.

530
34:12.880 --> 34:14.639
Long time no see.

531
34:14.719 --> 34:15.639
Missed you guys so much.

532
34:22.440 --> 34:23.360
Let me give you a quick update.

533
34:23.440 --> 34:25.800
Today I'm doing the preliminary delivery with the Reinsurance Department.

534
34:27.120 --> 34:28.120
Let's talk about it at the morning meeting.

535
34:28.199 --> 34:30.760
-Okay. -Uh, I can't make the morning meeting.

536
34:30.840 --> 34:32.560
And I need to take some time off.

537
34:32.639 --> 34:35.760
At 8:40, I'm meeting Mr. Sun to check the database.

538
34:35.840 --> 34:37.400
And tomorrow, I'm going on a business trip with him.

539
34:38.080 --> 34:40.120
We're hitting Celestial's data centers

540
34:40.199 --> 34:42.239
in Guangzhou, Shenzhen, Chengdu, and Suzhou

541
34:42.320 --> 34:44.400
to do on-site training delivery.

542
34:44.480 --> 34:46.000
Probably won't be back until the weekend.

543
34:46.080 --> 34:47.600
That many places in such a short time?

544
34:47.679 --> 34:48.679
Can your body handle it?

545
34:49.280 --> 34:51.440
Okay, as long as you've got it planned out.

546
34:51.520 --> 34:52.679
No need to send daily reports.

547
34:52.760 --> 34:53.920
Just give me a summary when you're back.

548
34:56.280 --> 34:57.120
IT Department's on the 17th floor.

549
34:57.200 --> 34:58.560
I'll take the high-zone elevator.

550
34:58.640 --> 34:59.840
Bye.

551
35:03.320 --> 35:05.080
My bad. My bad.

552
35:08.200 --> 35:11.960
She's grinding right now, trying to pull ahead of me.

553
35:12.040 --> 35:13.080
Don't hold her back.

554
35:13.640 --> 35:14.600
No way.

555
35:14.680 --> 35:16.560
You've already been project manager for some time.

556
35:16.640 --> 35:18.280
Even if she knocks it out of the park with the IT Department,

557
35:18.360 --> 35:19.200
she still can't top you.

558
35:19.280 --> 35:21.680
Do you really think this hand-me-down project manager spot

559
35:21.760 --> 35:22.640
is worth all that much?

560
35:22.720 --> 35:25.000
She and I are both gunning for a partner.

561
35:25.080 --> 35:27.280
You think we care about some temporary title? No.

562
35:27.360 --> 35:29.520
What we care about is Mr. Pi and Sha Sha's

563
35:29.600 --> 35:32.440
overall evaluation after this project wraps.

564
35:32.520 --> 35:34.880
That affects how far I can go at Maxmise.

565
35:35.480 --> 35:36.920
-Get it? -Got it.

566
35:39.160 --> 35:41.080
Okay, I'm done talking to you.

567
35:41.680 --> 35:42.520
Have to go grind too.

568
35:45.440 --> 35:46.280
How about this?

569
35:46.360 --> 35:49.280
Let me grind with you at your place these next few days?

570
35:52.440 --> 35:53.400
You wish.

571
36:02.680 --> 36:04.240
MOM

572
36:06.600 --> 36:08.320
I'll take the stairs.

573
36:12.560 --> 36:13.640
Hey, Mom.

574
36:14.560 --> 36:16.000
What's up? I'm at work.

575
36:18.600 --> 36:19.600
A blind date?

576
36:21.040 --> 36:21.960
I'm not going.

577
36:22.040 --> 36:23.000
You guys promised me

578
36:23.080 --> 36:25.800
you'd never pull this blind date nonsense on me. I…

579
36:27.560 --> 36:28.400
Dad.

580
36:30.400 --> 36:32.880
Okay, I got it.

581
36:32.960 --> 36:33.960
I'll be there on time.

582
36:48.200 --> 36:49.400
BETTER HOME TOGETHER

583
37:05.080 --> 37:06.040
Tianna.

584
37:06.560 --> 37:09.160
Ms. Xue's son works in IT.

585
37:09.240 --> 37:12.040
I heard he's doing really well.

586
37:13.200 --> 37:14.680
Wow, that's impressive.

587
37:15.200 --> 37:17.640
So if my laptop breaks, can he fix it for me?

588
37:17.720 --> 37:18.600
Don't be silly.

589
37:18.680 --> 37:20.720
His company is huge.

590
37:21.240 --> 37:23.480
Come on. Don't pull that long face.

591
37:23.560 --> 37:27.360
Your dad wanted you to come and vet the guy for him.

592
37:27.440 --> 37:29.240
He recently got into some…

593
37:29.920 --> 37:30.960
What's it called again?

594
37:31.040 --> 37:32.720
It's a new business model, anyway.

595
37:33.360 --> 37:34.360
Perfect timing.

596
37:34.440 --> 37:36.920
Ms. Xue's son works in tech.

597
37:37.000 --> 37:38.840
Don't overthink it.

598
37:38.920 --> 37:40.280
It's not a blind date.

599
37:40.360 --> 37:42.240
Just think of it as making a new friend.

600
37:43.200 --> 37:44.160
Have a nice chat.

601
37:45.520 --> 37:46.760
Right this way. It's this private room.

602
37:46.840 --> 37:48.080
Thank you. Hui!

603
37:49.280 --> 37:51.080
-Come on. -You're already here.

604
37:51.680 --> 37:54.000
-Mrs. Xue is here. -So sorry. We're late.

605
37:54.080 --> 37:55.800
-Son, come on. -Quick.

606
37:55.880 --> 37:57.480
-Long time no see. -Exactly.

607
37:57.560 --> 37:59.080
-And this is…? -Tianna.

608
37:59.160 --> 38:00.400
Say hi.

609
38:00.480 --> 38:02.440
-Hi, Ms. Xue. -Hello.

610
38:02.520 --> 38:03.600
So pretty.

611
38:04.120 --> 38:07.920
Jin, Tianna also studied in the US.

612
38:08.000 --> 38:10.920
-She's a consultant now. -Okay, Mom.

613
38:12.040 --> 38:13.240
I know Mr. Shen.

614
38:13.840 --> 38:16.000
-He's a client of our company. -Know each other?

615
38:16.520 --> 38:20.840
-They've known each other. -So I'll go chat with him outside?

616
38:21.520 --> 38:22.760
-Sure. -Great.

617
38:22.840 --> 38:23.960
Go chat with her.

618
38:25.000 --> 38:25.960
Go on.

619
38:29.840 --> 38:32.400
The other day, you were chasing Lin down in the parking lot,

620
38:32.480 --> 38:34.280
and now you're out on a blind date.

621
38:34.360 --> 38:36.520
Mr. Shen, your time management is really something.

622
38:38.320 --> 38:39.800
Fellow sufferers of the same fate.

623
38:39.880 --> 38:41.120
Cut each other some slack.

624
38:41.200 --> 38:42.960
Aren't you out on a blind date behind your boyfriend's back?

625
38:45.360 --> 38:47.560
Don't talk nonsense. I don't have a boyfriend.

626
38:49.120 --> 38:51.120
Okay, whatever you say.

627
38:52.800 --> 38:54.240
You're really…

628
38:54.960 --> 38:56.520
Why are you being so snarky?

629
38:57.720 --> 38:58.720
No wonder Lin doesn't like you.

630
39:03.960 --> 39:04.840
What, did I say something wrong?

631
39:07.680 --> 39:08.760
No. You're right.

632
39:09.960 --> 39:10.840
She really doesn't like me.

633
39:12.600 --> 39:14.320
By the way, how's she been?

634
39:16.080 --> 39:16.920
You wanna know?

635
39:18.600 --> 39:22.000
You think I'd be nice enough to tell you?

636
39:28.080 --> 39:29.200
Let's make a deal.

637
39:29.280 --> 39:31.520
Tell me how she's been,

638
39:32.040 --> 39:36.080
and I guarantee your mom won't bug you for a long time.

639
39:39.080 --> 39:40.080
Really?

640
39:41.200 --> 39:42.960
-At least half a year? -A whole year, even.

641
39:46.720 --> 39:48.400
What do you think they're talking about?

642
39:48.480 --> 39:50.320
They're really hitting it off.

643
39:51.360 --> 39:52.280
Now tell me.

644
39:52.800 --> 39:54.000
How's she been?

645
39:55.560 --> 39:57.000
She's fine. Everything's normal.

646
39:58.040 --> 39:59.720
-That's it? -Yeah.

647
39:59.800 --> 40:00.880
That's worth a year?

648
40:00.960 --> 40:03.080
What else do you want?

649
40:03.160 --> 40:06.840
Lin got divorced and ended up in the hospital.

650
40:06.920 --> 40:10.040
After all that, she comes back to work as if nothing happened.

651
40:10.120 --> 40:12.760
You expect her to be heartbroken?

652
40:12.840 --> 40:14.160
Besides,

653
40:14.240 --> 40:17.840
you're the one pursuing her like crazy, not the other way around.

654
40:17.920 --> 40:19.000
Are you done?

655
40:19.520 --> 40:22.440
If you keep throwing out these useless comments,

656
40:22.520 --> 40:23.440
I'm calling off the deal.

657
40:24.040 --> 40:25.360
No, then what…

658
40:26.200 --> 40:27.600
Then what else do you want to know?

659
40:28.600 --> 40:29.800
I want to know…

660
40:38.200 --> 40:39.720
I don't even know what I want to know.

661
40:43.000 --> 40:46.520
I don't even know what she really wants.

662
40:49.160 --> 40:50.840
I told her to stop selling herself short,

663
40:51.760 --> 40:53.680
but she still told me to stay away.

664
40:53.760 --> 40:55.640
She said

665
40:55.720 --> 40:57.920
she wants to keep her dignity and her pride.

666
41:01.200 --> 41:02.040
What are you laughing at?

667
41:03.760 --> 41:04.680
Sorry.

668
41:05.360 --> 41:07.240
I'm just laughing at how dumb you are.

669
41:08.000 --> 41:09.160
What do you mean?

670
41:10.440 --> 41:13.560
What did she say she wanted to keep?

671
41:13.640 --> 41:14.840
Her dignity and pride.

672
41:14.920 --> 41:17.520
Then it must be because you did something

673
41:17.600 --> 41:19.120
that made her feel like she lost her dignity.

674
41:19.200 --> 41:21.240
That's like dragging someone who's scared of heights

675
41:21.320 --> 41:23.000
up to a rooftop and telling her,

676
41:23.080 --> 41:25.080
"Honey, don't be scared." Does that help?

677
41:29.640 --> 41:30.480
So that's it.

678
41:32.240 --> 41:34.080
Okay. Now you know. Go explain yourself.

679
41:36.400 --> 41:37.360
No rush.

680
41:38.520 --> 41:39.720
Never go into battle unprepared.

681
41:41.040 --> 41:42.280
Let me tell you something.

682
41:42.360 --> 41:45.840
Missy, don't think you can boss me around on everything.

683
41:46.440 --> 41:48.240
If you were actually good at this love stuff,

684
41:48.320 --> 41:49.960
you wouldn't be here tonight.

685
41:53.840 --> 41:55.080
I wasted my breath on you.

686
41:59.040 --> 42:00.240
It wasn't wasted.

687
42:01.320 --> 42:02.160
Come closer.

688
42:04.400 --> 42:05.480
I said come closer.

689
42:06.200 --> 42:07.680
Why should I come closer?

690
42:09.720 --> 42:10.920
The choice is yours.

691
42:19.760 --> 42:20.800
Is it okay now?

692
42:22.280 --> 42:24.520
-Take my arm. -Take your arm?

693
42:37.520 --> 42:38.520
On my cue.

694
42:39.040 --> 42:42.280
I'll count to three, and we turn around, look back,

695
42:42.360 --> 42:44.400
smile, and nod.

696
42:44.480 --> 42:45.320
Got it?

697
42:46.520 --> 42:48.240
I asked if you got it.

698
42:48.320 --> 42:49.160
Answer me properly.

699
42:51.520 --> 42:54.280
-Got it, Mr. Shen. -Three, two, one.

700
43:00.520 --> 43:02.200
You two go ahead and chat.

701
43:02.280 --> 43:03.640
You two have a nice talk.

702
43:06.760 --> 43:11.120
But holding arms on a first blind date is a bit much, isn't it?

703
43:11.200 --> 43:14.120
There's worse. Wanna try?

704
43:14.680 --> 43:16.400
-No thanks. -So it wasn't wasted, was it?

705
43:17.560 --> 43:18.680
No, Mr. Shen.
